# Docker build context = repo root (see voix-backend/Dockerfile, M20a).
# Without this file the whole monorepo — node_modules, .git, and the
# iOS/macOS native build trees — would be shipped to the daemon as build
# context, making `docker build .` slow and bloating layer cache keys.
# The Dockerfile uses selective COPY, so excluding the rest is safe.

# Dependency + VCS noise
**/node_modules
.git
.github

# The RN app + its native build artifacts are never part of the daemon
# image (the --filter install skips clients/* anyway).
clients

# Build outputs
**/dist
**/.pioenvs
**/.esphome
esphome

# Editor / OS cruft
.DS_Store
**/*.log
.claude
docs
